  "scientific_boundary": "The frozen V3 passed the predeclared one-shot independent holdout gate and all 36 families were within 3% of the experimental Oracle. The observed point metrics improve V1, including a maximum-regret reduction from 4.388% to 1.461%, but both predeclared paired 95% confidence intervals include zero. Therefore this record authorizes holdout generalization and no-observed-regression claims, not statistical-superiority claims. Phase 2G is permanently consumed and must never be used to tune V3 or relabeled as an independent holdout for a modified model. V3 is a Mask-placement optimizer for its frozen fragment, not a general Join-order or materialization optimizer."
